"description":"Elevate Resident Safety and Boost Staff Efficiency with the MGLiving Solutions App \n\nThe MGLiving app, specifically designed for communities utilizing Medical Guardian's MGLiving Solutions, enhances the management of emergency call systems in senior living environments. Whether you’re a Senior Living Community Director, Nurse, Caregiver, or Administrative Staff member, this app provides essential tools to streamline operational workflows and enhance resident safety. \n\nKey Features: \n\nReal-Time Alerts: Receive immediate notifications for triggered events like button pushes, fall detections, door sensor activations, and non-emergent assistance requests. Know exactly who needs help, where they are on the property, and the nature of the event. \nEvent Management: Acknowledge alarms, check in with residents, escalate incidents to the 24/7 monitoring center, and review the complete alarm history—all from your mobile device or tablet. \nResident Safety: Quickly locate residents anywhere on the property during emergencies, ensuring a rapid response and increased resident safety. \nOperational Efficiency: Seamlessly integrate with the MGLiving desktop portal, reducing response times and streamlining workflows across the community, boosting staff efficiency. \nConfigurable Experience: Tailor the app to meet the specific needs of your property, whether it's affordable housing, independent living, assisted living, memory care, or skilled nursing facilities. \nEnhanced Connectivity: Stay connected and aware of resident needs throughout the property, ensuring no call for assistance goes unanswered. \nPersonalized Access: Enjoy a custom experience tailored to the specific needs of each community staff role. \nNurse Call & e-Call Integration: Access everything available in a traditional nurse call system and emergency call (e-call) system—and more—from both hardware and software perspectives, ensuring comprehensive coverage for all types of emergency and non-emergency events. \nFully Connected Hardware: Utilize a wide range of devices, including help buttons, assistance buttons, pull cords, wall buttons, centralized WiFi / IP-based panels with cellular backup, repeaters, locators, wireless & location-enabled pendants with fall detection, sensor transmitters for mattresses, doors, etc., strobe lights, and personal emergency response devices. \nWho Is This App For? \n\nThe MGLiving Solutions App is designed for professionals managing emergency response systems in senior living communities, including: \n\nSenior Living Community Directors: Oversee resident safety with real-time monitoring and access to historical data. \nProperty Managers & Administrative Staff: Manage and configure emergency systems, ensuring the property’s specific needs are met. \nNurses & Caregivers: Respond to emergencies quickly and accurately, improving resident care and safety while reducing burnout. \nFacility Types: Ideal for use in affordable housing (including Section 202 & 811), independent living, assisted living, memory care, and skilled nursing facilities. \n\nWhy Choose MGLiving Solutions? \n\nMedical Guardian’s MGLiving Solutions app goes beyond traditional personal emergency response systems (PERS) by offering comprehensive management tools for nurse call and e-call systems. This app is crucial for staff who need to stay connected and aware of resident needs, ensuring safety and operational efficiency across all types of senior living communities.", "averageUserRating":5, "trackCensoredName":"MGLiving", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mgliving/id6670203733?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "trackId":6670203733, "trackName":"MGLiving", "bundleId":"com.mgliving", "userRatingCount":3}, 
